<title>CHILE: Chile's Copec 1996 net sharply lower.</title>
<headline>Chile's Copec 1996 net sharply lower.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean oil, forestry and fishing conglomerate Compania de Acero del Pacifico SA (Copec) reported the following results for last year.</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net earnings	    93.55	     186.03</p>
<p>Operating profit	21.23		20.71</p>
<p>Non-operating profit  75.47	     168.45</p>
<p>Revenues		 650.29	     543.87</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
